# Operator minimal input (hard contract)

**Scope:** Email processing agent chat only.

## Operator may type (only)

| Input | When |
|-------|------|
| **login** | Once per session start |
| **RE** | **First case of session only** (initial extract + 7-step + Auto-LF) |
| **PR** | End of each non-transfer EMAIL case (after Auto-LF at RE time) |
| **DONE** | End of workday |

**Physical Sprinklr clicks** (Anwenden, Weiter, Next, Senden, transfer UI) are **not** chat commands — operator clicks only.

## Forbidden operator commands (never ask for these)

- **NEXT**, **RE** (case 2+), **LF**, **LF TR**, **RE SHOW**, **pickup**, **await**, or any “type X to continue” after Prowler / extract / arm.

If automation stalls, agent **fixes internally** (`--pickup`, `--closeout-*`, re-await) — **never** push work back to the operator.

## Agent auto-pipeline (no operator input between cases)

### First case

1. **login** → Case Tracker tab (login-only script).
2. Operator **RE** once → extract → 7-step → play-ready → Auto-LF → wait **PR**.

### Every case after first

1. Operator **PR** only (paste path).
2. **Same PR turn (mandatory):** start **background** closeout listen (last shell action before turn ends):

```powershell
uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/run.py --closeout-anwenden
```

Use `--closeout-weiter` / `--closeout-extern` after transfer Auto-LF; `--closeout-next` after CALL Auto-LF.

- `block_until_ms: 0` (background) + `notify_on_output` pattern: `AWAIT_ARM_EXTRACT_DONE|RE_TEXT_ONLY_GATE|CALL_LF_GATE|DETACHED_ARM_EXTRACT_READY`
- Operator clicks Sprinklr close-out button only.
3. On notify **or** stop-hook `[AUTO_PIPELINE]` follow-up: **immediate** 7-step (EMAIL) or voice Auto-LF (CALL) — **no new operator message**.
4. Wait **PR** again.

## Prowler = extract done

Prowler (`ARMED_RE_START_SOUND`) means extract finished. Agent **must** continue RE + Auto-LF automatically via notify or stop hook — **never** stop idle.

## Stop hook backup

`.cursor/hooks/extract_auto_continue_hook.py` on **stop** submits `[AUTO_PIPELINE]` follow-up when `extract_ready.json` is pending — no operator typing.

## Transfer / CALL

- Transfer Auto-LF → `--closeout-weiter` or `--closeout-extern` (background + notify) — no PR.
- CALL Auto-LF → `--closeout-next` (background + notify) — no PR unless asked.
